The absence of a capability does not mean that iRiel Personal Intelligence ceases to exist.
INTELLIGENCE AS A SERVICE TO THE HUMAN
Core AI exists to improve the human’s ability to understand, create, decide, communicate, access, and act.
It must not optimize intelligence for its own sake.
The objective is not:
Maximum model capability.
The objective is:
Appropriate intelligence for the human, context, and purpose.
A smaller or local model may be preferable when it adequately satisfies the request while providing greater privacy, lower latency, lower resource consumption, or better accessibility.
A larger model may be preferable when the task genuinely requires greater reasoning or capability.
The correct choice belongs to the broader routing and orchestration architecture.
Core AI provides the capability.
It does not independently decide the entire system strategy.
