The Maestro may preserve context.
The System may communicate the transition.
The Personal Intelligence remains continuous.
Fallback must respect privacy and authorization.
A remote fallback must not be used merely because a local capability failed if remote processing is prohibited.
A lower-capability fallback must not silently produce materially different results without appropriate handling.
